                                "sense_id": "463cc556-483c-3c2c-921c-53a8025825d1",
                                "text": "No matter what quotient of Josephine's actual features, Isabey's artful cosmetics, or David's own inventions made it onto the final canvas, Josephine's berouged face evoked the youth and vitality valued in fertile females."
